{"about":["\"Platform 8\" is a sequel to \"The Exit 8\". You will enjoy it more if you have played the previous title.","You are trapped on a train that runs forever. Keep an eye out for anomalies and find a way out.","Please be aware of any train anomalies...","Platform 8 is a short walking simulator inspired by Japanese subways, liminal spaces, and the Backrooms."],"shots":[{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202410/3005/891a65691859bfa12ca013ba6dccc6ebd29161d6df157449.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202410/3005/891a65691859bfa12ca013ba6dccc6ebd29161d6df157449.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202410/3005/4a861c9ae3a1a097941feb76bc57c5b290338df1e9e00fcf.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202410/3005/4a861c9ae3a1a097941feb76bc57c5b290338df1e9e00fcf.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202410/3005/b13accd363b0410a8ebd5c3df11ee3264e0a30f65e9e4f1f.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202410/3005/b13accd363b0410a8ebd5c3df11ee3264e0a30f65e9e4f1f.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202410/3005/61fe07078b98e1cc3cc7034654933fb451ed0d29bcdc6749.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202410/3005/61fe07078b98e1cc3cc7034654933fb451ed0d29bcdc6749.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"}],"summary":"You are trapped on a train that runs forever."}